    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is one of the largest indoor saunas that we have and it is one of the two indoor saunas. MoonLight models have more glass panels for better illumination, the Golden models favor privacy and have fewer (although still enough) glass panels.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The construction of this robust sauna relies on the Canadian natural red cedar wood which gives it an authentic look and feel. Combining authenticity with the comfort you get a very cozy interior for up to five people.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can use abundant space for exercise if you&rsquo;re on your own as well.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A sauna is a sanctuary of health, but you also need peace and quiet to go along with heat to enjoy it to the fullest extent. The heaters supplied with this sauna are manufactured by Harvia for your comfort, they are energy-efficient and great for long-term usage.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy this sauna the way you want with whom you want, we&rsquo;re only starting to uncover all the benefits of sauna usage but we know already that it makes you feel very good indeed.</span></p>\r\n<br />Traditional Heating Technology requires: Hardwire. Hardwire is recommended, if you opt to a plug, we will send you the following plug for the BC45-E heater:",
